<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 7.19 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 7.19 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 7.19 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for April 23		   10,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for April	    6,334</p>
<p> Average reserves to April 20			 5,908</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    7,193</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
